and for different purposes,

01:48:19.230 --> 01:48:21.000
for mental work, for
physical work, et cetera,

01:48:21.000 --> 01:48:22.800
and find what is best for you.

01:48:22.800 --> 01:48:25.541
Once again, the goal
is to teach your brain,

01:48:25.541 --> 01:48:30.180
that is to increase neuroplasticity
in the neural circuits

01:48:30.180 --> 01:48:31.800
that allow you not just to focus,

01:48:31.800 --> 01:48:33.840
