01:48:33.840 --> 01:48:36.037
And I'd be remiss if I didn't mention

01:48:36.037 --> 01:48:39.300
that it's also critical
to be able to defocus.

01:48:39.300 --> 01:48:42.671
I highly encourage people to
take a period of time each day

01:48:42.671 --> 01:48:44.850
